{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["נבוכים הם — before them. Like נבכי ים. Therefore they turned back, for they did not know where to go. כי סגר עליהם המדבר — their way, for it is a place of serpent, viper, and scorpion and dangerous beasts, and they feared pursuit from behind them. And therefore they stayed in the place where they were encamped, באתם בקצה המדבר, and now they have come between Migdol and the sea to encamp by the sea, and behold they are נבוכים — נבכי ים before them; behold, they have no place to flee, neither forward nor backward. נבוכים — enclosed by the נבכי ים before them, as written: ״הבאת עד נבכי ים״. From מבכי נהורת."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:41:26.063318236Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}